-    Args:
-        timesteps: Integer steps, shape (B,).
-        dim: Embedding dimension (must be even).
-        max_period: Controls the minimum frequency.
-
-    Returns:
-        Tensor of shape (B, dim) on the same device as ``timesteps``.
